    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes discrete profile data collected during the R/V Maria S. Merian cruise MSM72 (EXPOCODE 06M220180302) in the Mediterranean Sea from 2018-03-02 to 2018-04-03. These data include dissolved inorganic carbon (DIC), total alkalinity (TA), pH on total scale, chlorofluorocarbon 12 (CFC-12), sulfur hexaflouride (SF6), water temperature, salinity, dissolved oxygen, silicate, nitrate, nitrite and phosphate measurements.",
